# machine run artifacts (usually live in /tmp/stanok-logs, outside the repo)
.stanok-logs/
*.launch.log
/.claude/settings.local.json

# supervisor zone: local-only, NEVER published (rule: .claude/sync-skeleton.sh;
# pinned by test_supervisor_zone_not_published in stanok/launcher/tests_harness)
CONTEXT.md
# tickets: private (operator decision 2026-10-13) — the machine reads them from
# this local directory; untracked from the public tree (history NOT rewritten —
# old commits keep them; RA-7 covers the LAN addresses they contain)
tickets/
# specs/: the supervisor's working zone (SPEC-*/PLAN-*/REVIEW-*/NOTE-*/RUNBOOK/
# STATUS/RISK-ACCEPTANCES/ARCHIVE/ANALYSIS-*) — local-only, untracked 2026-10-15
# (operator decision: the public repo is a clean infra mirror; history NOT
# rewritten — same policy as tickets/). The ONLY specs/ file that stays tracked
# is specs/STACKS.md: the infra doc pinned by the CC-147 doctor test in the
# public clone (test_doctor.py reads REPO_ROOT.parent/specs/STACKS.md).
specs/*
!specs/STACKS.md
